cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these editions, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "Latvian music: songs with Latvian words, transcribed from old prints"
abstract: >-
  Editions of printed music with Latvian words, transcribed note by note and word by
  word from scans of the prints and checked against them: the music as LilyPond
  sources, the words in the old orthography as printed. First: Ādams Ore, Lettische
  Volkslieder / Latweeschu tautas dseesmas, for voice and piano (Riga [1890]).
authors:
  - name: "just-a-book-archivist"
repository-code: "https://github.com/just-a-book-archivist/latvian-music"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
keywords:
  - Latvian
  - folk songs
  - sheet music
  - LilyPond
  - old orthography
  - Ādams Ore
